# Butler Routes - Darkshore recipes and patterns companion (pack butler-routes-completionist, v1).
# Only recipes whose SOURCE is physically in Darkshore, verified against the
# local Forever game data (questie-forever item and vendor tables). Thirteen
# recipes are sold by the zone's own vendors in Auberdine, by Heldan Galesong
# on the shore south of it, and by Bale at the grove. Every dropped recipe
# with any Darkshore source also drops elsewhere (generic world drops), and
# quest records carry no reward data (see docs/companion-unverified.md).
# Trainer-taught staples are excluded: Polestar's own profession guides cover
# those. Each step is gated to its profession; other characters skip it cleanly.
# Professions with no Darkshore source (Blacksmithing, Engineering, Enchanting,
# First Aid, Fishing, Alchemy) are named here rather than padded.
guide butler-routes-completionist/darkshore-recipes
title Darkshore - Recipes & Patterns
levels 10-20
zone Darkshore
faction Alliance
category Professions
folder Companions
keywords darkshore, recipes, patterns, professions, companions
coords live
version 1

step Cooking — Auberdine (Laird)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 4200 -- Laird (36.77, 44.28)
  buy 5485 "Recipe: Fillet of Frenzy"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Heldan Galesong
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 4307 -- Heldan Galesong (36.97, 56.35)
  buy 5528 "Recipe: Clam Chowder"
  buy 6368 "Recipe: Rainbow Fin Albacore"
  buy 6369 "Recipe: Rockscale Cod"
  buy 17062 "Recipe: Mithril Head Trout"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Cooking — Bale (high-level vendor)
  when skill Cooking 1

  vendor 2806 -- Bale (50.4, 74.2)
  buy 16110 "Recipe: Monster Omelet"
  note Bale is far above the zone band and also spawns in Felwood — buy it later if you cannot reach him now. Stock class is not in the local data.

step Tailoring — Auberdine (Valdaron)
  when skill Tailoring 1

  vendor 4189 -- Valdaron (38.15, 40.6)
  buy 5771 "Pattern: Red Linen Bag"
  buy 5772 "Pattern: Red Woolen Bag"
  buy 6270 "Pattern: Blue Linen Vest"
  buy 253665 "Pattern: Linen Reagent Bag"
  buy 253668 "Pattern: Woolen Reagent Bag"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.

step Leatherworking — Auberdine (Mavralyn)
  when skill Leatherworking 1

  vendor 4186 -- Mavralyn (37, 41.2)
  buy 5786 "Pattern: Murloc Scale Belt"
  buy 5787 "Pattern: Murloc Scale Breastplate"
  note Stock class (limited vs unlimited) is not in the local data; if out of stock, come back later.
